---
// TDXN showcase. The sample is the real export of the network behind the
// practice-section frames (Embody 6.2.13, TD 2025.33070), trimmed to fit:
// long help strings cut to their first sentence, most GLSL elided, some
// parameters and operators dropped. Every line that remains is verbatim.
---

<section class="section section--tdn">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">the format underneath</p>
    <h2 class="section__title">meet TDXN.</h2>

    <p class="lede">
      TDXN, <strong>TouchDesigner eXternal Network</strong>, writes a network out as one human-readable YAML file: operators, parameters, connections, layout, annotations, DAT content. All of it in text, so every change is a diff, and every version is a file your agent, your team, and git can all read.
    </p>

    <div class="tdn__grid">
      <pre class="code" aria-label="kandinsky.tdxn, the network behind the frames above, trimmed"><code><span class="c-k">format</span><span class="c-p">:</span> <span class="c-s">tdxn</span>
<span class="c-k">version</span><span class="c-p">:</span> <span class="c-s">'2.1'</span>
<span class="c-k">generator</span><span class="c-p">:</span> <span class="c-s">Embody/6.2.13</span>
<span class="c-k">td_build</span><span class="c-p">:</span> <span class="c-s">099.2025.33070</span>
<span class="c-k">source_file</span><span class="c-p">:</span> <span class="c-s">Embody-6.316.toe</span>
<span class="c-k">exported_at</span><span class="c-p">:</span> <span class="c-s">'2026-09-05T15:47:23Z'</span>
<span class="c-k">network_path</span><span class="c-p">:</span> <span class="c-s">/embody/kandinsky</span>
<span class="c-k">type</span><span class="c-p">:</span> <span class="c-s">baseCOMP</span>
<span class="c-k">custom_pars</span><span class="c-p">:</span>
  <span class="c-k">Kandinsky</span><span class="c-p">:</span>
  <span class="c-p">-</span> <span class="c-k">name</span><span class="c-p">:</span> <span class="c-s">Seed</span>
